    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "rita yegouchian",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112771082752591014139/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVPINzJdnL1oHPw5zbKzz2Gd63zGIqJtoxmS8hbOlu4mqOXbVj46A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Dear Iners of Kinatex Vaudreuil I salute you all . I would like you to carefully read my review as I write from my heart and health four years ago I came to the clinic and was seen by  physio Mme Angel( now retired) even though not her jurisdiction she helped a lot Then I had the God send to be introduced to Miss Katherina R. The massage therapist I came to her completely broken enable to breath or function in any way and after 90 minutes of incredibly knowledgeable specific maneuvers I left a healthy happy relaxed hopeful person ❤️The amount of listening and care Katherina has is incredible. She specifically can hear and feel my needs and conducts a very healing professional session. I am forever grateful to her for healing me time after time with care and professionalism. You must gift yourself such a blessing healing therapy. Thank you Katherina.",
        "time": 1769358814,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Amélie Rouillard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107311713003089616883/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIs8Eb9ttXlvGKARWi7L3qsZQcoonfxg6PydbeeaUegovuAZQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "As a breast cancer patient, there is no one but Olivia that I trust with my physical therapy and range of motion recovery. She is professionnal, kind and very knowledgeable. I cannot recommend her enough.",
        "time": 1743778795,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nazir Jabban",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102670612027894524625/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX1d3jpDzIRjYLIi_b0y4_mWWlpg_JNKP8PJXykYwD5QGcLY38J=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Very classy treatment from the reception staff and my personal therapist, Madame Melanie, she has magical hands :) Thank you so much to everyone",
        "time": 1752244961,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gail Kaneb",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101363741735914470912/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJZqCjjOLYKVdimxK5sCn_XTfusii96F7VJ47AZ-Vi0Jk8Tpw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Great clinic - clean, no wait, excellent staff. Katharina is an incredible physiotherapist.  She is a whole level above anyone I’ve gong to before. She gets to the root of the problem and fixes it. After 4 years of trying with others, I found Katharina, and she has healed my problem.",
        "time": 1734705567,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chris Faraday",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108174804473713446090/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUXrZMXELzCb5SYcibNR5XUN-vNTaOfLdNhsFtLk4fm7xdtj4I=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "A huge thank you to this team. They went above and beyond to get my son an appointment. He had a big race and we were scrambling to find someone to see him. They shuffled schedules and were able to do an assessment and some treatment. Taught him how to apply some tape to support his injury. I can't thank them enough for their efforts. Great spot and highly recommend them.",
        "time": 1715620853,
